body:
Some of the stuff that broke long paths appears to be happening in the powershell part. Here's a fix:
```suggestion
function Invoke-Native {
    param($Executable, $Arguments)

    $startInfo = New-Object System.Diagnostics.ProcessStartInfo -ArgumentList $Executable -Property  @{
        # Use UTF-8
        StandardOutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8;
        # Required for UTF-8
        RedirectStandardOutput = $true;

        CreateNoWindow         = $true;
        UseShellExecute        = $false;
    }

    
    foreach ($arg in $Arguments) {
        $startInfo.ArgumentList.Add($arg)
    }

    [System.Diagnostics.Process]::Start($startInfo).StandardOutput.ReadToEnd()
}
```

